{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_st01",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_st01",
  "title": "永別了，鹽漠",
  "storyCode": "EP-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a786ae58d2dbd4279c52d4a18228a564ae7956dbe14ce6bd793c90edae77494f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他努力適應水中的昏暗，找尋湖底微弱的金屬光澤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他划動手臂，緩緩向前游動，手指伸入淤泥，只能抓到絲絲水草。\n冰冷的湖水在肌膚表面與頭髮之間流動，他感到困惑，不知道該如何才能找到那枚金幣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有個聲音從岸上傳來，隔著湖水，他看不清那人的面容，但溫柔親切的語氣讓他生出幾分相信。\n於是他閉上眼，感知水流湧動，水底的圖景在他腦海中清晰地繪出——\n一枚堅硬的、花紋繁複的金屬圓片躺在游弋的水草中。\n他撫摸圓片上的花紋，然後握在手心向水面游去，岸上，那人的面孔越來越清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他攤開掌心，金幣上，一個精細的圓形圖案被一道橫線攔腰分開，恍惚間，他覺得那像是自己未曾謀面的，遙遠的海平線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "什麼味道……又腥又鹹……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "text": "哼哧……哼哧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "text": "（吐出舌頭）哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "不准舔我的臉，小傢伙，我真的會揍你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "text": "哼哧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……算了，以後也不會再生你的氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗糙的男聲",
      "text": "小子，你的飯來了，快點吃吧！大姐頭等著見你呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "她今天見不到我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊西多扯下房間裡的帆布吊床，將盤子中堅硬的麵包和小半瓶水包起來。\n隨即踢開旁邊的皮箱，露出底下的洞口。\n為了挖掘這條通道，伊西多花費了整整一週。\n一旁怪模怪樣的動物靠近伊西多並親暱地叼住他的褲腳，他看著被口水弄濕的褲子，嘆了口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "我絕對不會再回到這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潑辣的女人",
      "text": "（口哨）哈維爾，我上個月放在這裡的那把刀能拿回去了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潑辣的女人",
      "text": "哈維爾！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "哦……抱歉，蒂奇，我沒聽到你在說話。你是來拿刀的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "不然呢？難道來看你被汗浸濕的胸膛嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "你們不該總開這樣的玩笑，蒂奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "別這麼說嘛，你清晨起來磨刀的身影已經是這裡的一道風景了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "看看這四周圍過來的人……他們可不像是來請你磨刀的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旁觀的男人",
      "text": "（拋媚眼）嗨，哈維爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "真是亂七八糟……拿著吧，蒂奇，這是你的刀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "我們沒有多少金屬能修補武器了，只能想點其他辦法，這段時間你先勉強用一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "骨頭和貝殼？你手還真巧啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "要試刀嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "你這裡有什麼堅硬的食材可以試刀嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "本來還有一塊乾麵包……但剛剛送去給棚屋裡的小子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "浪費。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "讓開讓開，你們一大早沒事情做嗎？堵在這裡幹嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "魯斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "原來是你啊，我就說怎麼才一大早，太陽就那麼刺眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "我沒時間和你鬥嘴，快，哈維爾，進去裡面說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "看起來不像是我能聽的，我該走了，哈維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旁觀的男人",
      "text": "真是掃興……哈維爾，明天再見哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "（小聲）嘖……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "你得勸勸胡安娜，她瘋了，她會把所有人都害死的！哈維爾，在她身邊的人中你是腦袋最清醒的了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "她不是一直都這個樣子嗎，魯斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "想想這麼多年來，她的決定哪一次不是看似瘋狂，實則是為大家找到新出路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "十幾年前，如果不是她冒險接觸那支商隊，誰能想到我們還能靠賣鹽漠裡挖出的古董過活？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "那時根本沒有人贊同她，大家都害怕見利忘義的商人會向審判庭透露船隊的位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "但胡安娜向他們展示了這樁交易的價值所在，開出他們無法拒絕的條件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "哈維爾，這次不一樣，這次真的不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "魯斯，無論如何，身為首領，她始終值得我們信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "哈維爾，她要帶我們重返海洋啊。就算這樣你也一如既往地支持她嗎？你真的認同那是新出路嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "不，哈維爾，那是條毀滅之路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "魯斯，樂觀點，她找到了羅盤，找到了能修復它的術師，一切正如預期發展，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "就算你每天都窩在廚房什麼都不管，至少也該注意到最近送進廚房裡的都是什麼鱗屎食材吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "你看看，這些全都是胡安娜採購木材的帳單，為了修那艘沒用的老破船，為了出她的海。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "木材有多貴你又不是不知道。這些錢本來可以讓大家過得好一點，你本來可以不用這樣每天委屈地醃這些肝臟，泡這些鹹鱗汁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "趁她還沒有投入更多，去勸勸她吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "有些不好的話……正在聚落裡面傳播，搞得人心不安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "我會去找她談談的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "不過，魯斯，不要忘記，沒有胡安娜，沒有你口中的那個瘋女人，我們的祖輩、我們的父輩，還有我們……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "都沒辦法在這片鹽漠活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "奇怪……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "那個經常坐在門口的廚師跑去哪裡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "該死……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……是來抓我回去的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個男人氣勢洶洶地從街角出現，伊西多匆忙地躲進角落的陰影裡。\n但男人並非是為他而來的，只是罵罵咧咧地走過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣勢洶洶的男人",
      "text": "蠢貨，你們這些蠢貨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣勢洶洶的男人",
      "text": "等著吧，那個臭婆娘會把我們都害死的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "清醒一點，塞斯克，你又偷吃那個女孩帶來的草藥了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "該清醒的是你們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "難道只有我一個人對那個臭婆娘有滿肚不滿嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "懦夫！沒有一個人敢說實話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "滾開，要發瘋別在大街上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "我說錯了嗎！蒂奇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "難道你對那瘋婆娘沒有一絲懷疑嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "你也像哈維爾一樣被她那些瘋瘋癲癲的鬼話蠱惑了嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "塞斯克……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "哈維爾，好了，那傢伙腦袋不清楚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "再說一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "你再說一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "難道不是嗎，哈維爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "這麼多年你對那瘋婆娘百依百順，她說的一切你都支持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "我們都知道，你才是她最忠心的寵物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "不如你就放下你手中的刀，趴在地上去舔她的鞋吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "抓住男人的衣領，哈維爾將他高高提起，隨即，男人的後背狠狠地撞在牆壁上。\n哈維爾面容沉靜，但他眼中熊熊燃燒的火焰幾乎要將男人灼燒成灰燼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "不會打起來吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "要是打起來，也好趁亂跑出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "呃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "不要讓我再聽到這種話，哪怕是睡覺，也不要說這種夢話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "聽到了嗎，塞斯克？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "被扼住喉嚨的男人幾乎窒息，周圍卻沒有一人敢上前阻攔，只是默默低下頭繞開。\n道路兩旁，棚屋中的人陸續將門窗閉緊，不過片刻，路上便已空空蕩蕩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "哈維爾，鬆手，他知道教訓了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "（小聲）別在這裡，哈維爾……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "回答我！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "（胡亂點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "text": "咳……咳咳咳——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "回去吧，小子，記住教訓，記牢點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "唉，哈維爾，怎麼回事？你不是這麼衝動的人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "text": "衝動？當然不，他只是清楚地向所有人表明了態度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "魯斯，我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "text": "放心，晚上帶一點東西去找他，他不會把你關在門外的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "好，謝謝你，蒂奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在路中央站了一下子，哈維爾目送女人離開。\n一方頭巾被吹到他腳下，正是剛剛匆匆逃走的男人落下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈維爾撿起它，拍了拍塵土，走回棚屋將房門輕輕掩上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "正好，一個人都不剩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "還以為要一直等到中午，他們都去避暑時……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "嘖……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "我上次怎麼會想到晚上逃跑的？那可是這些傢伙最活躍的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（從這裡下去……我就能離開了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（這裡只有兩個守衛，打暈了就好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "咳咳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（嗯……？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "那個，安妮，你……有沒有想過去其他地方看一看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "上次挖出來的老錢幣，我自己藏了一點，把上面的國王頭像都磨平了，和現在流通的沒有兩樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "我可以帶你離開這片鹽漠，我們兩個人，去雷姆必拓，去哥倫比亞……只要你想，我們可以去任何地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "不，何塞，我出生在這裡，從沒想過離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "安妮，你真的要留在這裡追隨首領進入海洋嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "她是我的首領。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "海可是會吃人的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "我不害怕，首領承諾過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "我害怕，那個承諾太不現實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "如果你害怕，可以離開，我不會阻攔你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "……我倒是希望你能阻攔我，安妮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（有完沒完？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "如果你不願意和我一起離開，那至少……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "至少什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（她的拒絕還不夠明顯嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "安妮……你可以留給我一個……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（吞吞吐吐，真是拖——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "哼，吞吞吐吐，真是拖拖拉拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（……？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看不慣眼前扭扭捏捏的男人，女人一把將他推倒，然後捧住他的臉，吻了上去。\n躲在一旁的伊西多見此情景擰緊眉頭，撇開目光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心不在焉的守衛",
      "text": "唔……安妮……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡職盡責的守衛",
      "text": "閉嘴吧你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "（……至少這下子他們注意不到我了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "得再跑快一點……如果天黑前不能逃出去……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "根據前幾次的情況，一定會……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨大的舵輪從他面前擦過，插在腳下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你不該讓一位女士等你這麼久的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "乖乖和我回去吧，小傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "你不該在這裡的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘗試過那麼多次，你還沒有放棄嗎？如果再受傷，我們這裡可沒有多餘的藥物讓你拿去敷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "你到底是怎麼知道我離開的，胡安娜女士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "我確認過了，沒有人跟著我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "身為首領，我對船隊裡的動靜清楚得很，你躲不過我的耳目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "況且，追問一個不想給你答案的女人是不會有好結果的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青年沒有說話，暗自懷念起那把陪伴自己多年的長劍，如果它還在，或許能多幾分勝算。\n但它斷了，和他即將獲得的自由一樣，在這片鹽漠斷成兩截。\n伊西多握緊拳頭，咬緊牙關，試圖抓住些剩下的東西。\n而女人只是輕輕拔出自己的長劍，姿態放鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "休想攔我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "嗯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不過幾劍，赤手空拳的他便落敗下來，倒在地上啃了一嘴鹽後，伊西多連最後的東西也沒能保住。\n胡安娜把他五花大綁抗在肩上，他感覺到有什麼在內心輕輕地碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "年輕真好，永遠不知放棄，被擊敗多少次都會幻想還能有下一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "如果你真想離開這裡，那就給我把羅盤修好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "我和你講過很多次，只有煉金術師能修，我又不是煉金術師！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "是嗎？那你能否解釋一下那枚金幣的來歷呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……我偷的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "小傢伙，你撒謊的技術可不怎麼好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "那上面可不是什麼眾人皆知的標誌，它代表著一個早已被人遺忘的煉金流派……它秘傳的技藝為無數艦隊尋得了海中的寶藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "大靜謐後，它的門徒被囚禁，它的產物被摧毀……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "告訴我，在如此情況下，你為何還要留著那枚金幣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "我什麼也不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "啊，嘴硬的小傢伙，既然如此，可否回答我另一個問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "那個洞你到底是怎麼挖的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……你們給我的麵包真的很硬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "啊，你確實是個聰明的小傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "老天，真是太感謝你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "辛苦你盯著那小傢伙了，要不是你及時向我通報，搞不好他就真的溜走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "嗯，我知道，他可不是什麼安分的囚徒，但我們有你不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "你可是我們之中最聰明、最機靈、最厲害的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "寶寶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "text": "哼哧哼哧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "text": "（興奮地轉圈）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "哦，寶寶，別太激動，你的盯梢任務仍然艱巨，絕不能掉以輕心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "text": "（迅速地癱倒）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "我當然相信你，好了，快去吧，可不要被那個小傢伙發現你的身分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "text": "哼哧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "進來吧，小哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "胡安娜女士，我打擾了您和寶寶的美好時光嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "text": "哼哧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "別總對我齜牙咧嘴，我帶了些好東西來給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "真精緻的小骨球……你雕的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "嗯，從廢舊武器上拆下來一些碎骨頭，沒地方用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "雕成後我本來想送給魯斯賠罪的，但他把我拒於門外了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "哦……我聽說了，你不該那麼衝動。作為船隊的水手長，魯斯對出海計劃提出質疑是分內的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "而你當面攻擊他的手下，對他來說是一種粗暴的警告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "你才剛升任大廚，低調一點，有些想法不一定要說出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "他縱容手下在大庭廣眾之下辱駡您，不也是一種粗暴的挑釁嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "無妨，小哈。我自己都不介意，你又何必煩惱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "因為，我知道自己追隨的人，不是一個拿大家性命開玩笑的瘋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "好孩子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "胡安娜女士，如果修復那枚羅盤，它真的能指引我們避開海怪，找到資源嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "當然，我從不騙你，小哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "……鹽漠無法供養我們世代生息，真正取之不竭的資源仍在海中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "此時此刻，“羅盤”和能修復它的煉金術師都在我們手裡。這將是一個徹底改變目前境遇的機會，不該錯過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "但胡安娜女士，除了您，我們之中沒人見過海洋，也沒人經歷過那個黃金般的富饒時代。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "自我有記憶起，便生活在這片鹽漠了，但老廚師卻說百年前這裡曾是一片良田。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "很難說大靜謐後，豐饒的海洋會不會只是另一片鹽漠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "再神奇的羅盤……也無法指回過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "“潮水將抹去我的足跡，海風將吹散浪的碎沫。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "“但海與岸仍在——永在。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "什麼……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "一首舊詩罷了，小哈，不同於陸地，海洋是頑強的，哪怕它感染了異種的血肉，也依舊生機盎然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "它曾經屬於我們，也可以再度屬於我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "我願意相信您，胡安娜女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "只是那些流言……您得向大家證實，自己所言非虛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "我會的，小哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "對了，女士……我按您的指示去棚屋看過了，地上有個洞，給我一個晚上就能填好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "那個小子今晚要怎麼辦？棚屋肯定是待不了了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "放心，我已經安置好他了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "您把他丟到哪裡了？先說好，我可不會收留他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "text": "哦，小哈，不必如此著急，你回去的路上會知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "你這個混帳東西，賣給我的假腿是什麼破爛！不過兩天就斷成兩截了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "哎呀，修一修不就又能用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "鱗屎坨子，我現在就要把你的腿打斷拿來用！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "欸……欸，這是幹嘛！退貨歸退貨，怎麼還要打人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "我我我，我有刀的！你別過來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "哈維爾！正好你來了，幫我逮住這小丫頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "傻大個，給我讓開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "嘖……真會惹事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "哎呦！痛哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "把錢還給他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "放開我！我要告訴胡安娜女士，你們都欺負我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "小姐，識相點，這裡不是你耍嘴皮子的地方，我們和鎮子裡的孬種不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "如果你犯錯，我們可不會費事把你囚禁起來審判。左手和右手，你想留哪隻？自己選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "你、你敢！要不是我，你們的首領能拿到羅盤嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "要試試嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "呃……我退錢，可以了吧。你把假腿還給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "休想，裝在我腿上就是我的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "你、你們這群強盜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "感謝您對我們的身分有如此清晰的認知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "哈哈……一時嘴快……錢在這裡，告辭，我先離開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "首領到底在想些什麼？竟然把這個狡猾的丫頭留在船隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "她的決定自然有她的道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "還有那個小子，聽說又跑了，不能直接把他的腿打斷嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "結果首領把他抓回來後就丟在這裡，還命令我們不能傷他一根毛。氣死了，看這小黑臉，真想捶一拳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "欸，哈維爾，我就是想想，你不要真的去啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的男人",
      "text": "欸——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "跑了一整天，你要喝口水嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "你打算就這樣一直不說話嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "我不會向你們屈服的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "喔，隨便你好了，小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "我只是來告訴你一個壞消息，你恐怕要在這裡過夜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……無所謂，我不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "text": "那就好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "…………",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "晨光落在金幣上，將一道光反射在伊西多的眼皮上，他眨眨眼睛。光波流轉間，金幣上的圓形圖案蕩漾起來。\n伊西多覺得不太舒服，將金幣遞給岸邊的男人，但對方並未著急接過，而是伸手抓住男孩的雙腳將他倒提起來。\n男孩掙扎不休，而岸邊的男人開口說："
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夕陽的餘暉灑在她的身上，隨著時間的推移，又漸漸遠去。\n路上的行人接連走過，每個人都忍不住轉過頭笑了起來。\n伊西多有些頭暈，隱約的笑聲讓他的血液湧上臉頰，但那也可能是一直被倒掛所導致的。\n鹽地中，一座又一座簡陋的帳篷與板屋被東拼西湊地搭起。\n龐大的鹽船停靠在街道兩側，像幾頭打瞌睡的海獸。\n桅杆上，集雨用的布袋升入天空，在風中等待著雲的到來。\n道路上，人們並肩走著，嬉笑打鬧，突然有人爆發爭吵，隨後，演變成一場衝突與混戰。\n而在靜謐的角落裡，有人親暱地挽著愛人，交換了一個吻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "真是一群野蠻的強盜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卑鄙的攤販",
      "text": "難以想像，我到底為什麼會來這破地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "text": "問得好，帕斯卡拉，我又是怎麼掉進這賊窩的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "text": "咳咳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "text": "這我就不清楚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
